{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2022-05/1065226/block/singleImage/3275320/wm/009_12.jpg?updatedAt=1795420134\"/><figcaption>荃灣石圍角邨有人墮樓亡。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>荃灣有人墮樓亡。今日(23日)早上9時59分，石圍角邨保安員報案，指一名男子懷疑由高處墮下，倒臥於石葵樓對開行人路上。救護車接報到場將昏迷事主送往仁濟醫院搶救，惜證實不治。警員經初步調查，相信71歲姓黃男子為上址住戶，從大廈一走廊墮下，現場沒有檢獲遺書。案件列「自殺」處理，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:54:08.606771+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T07:48:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T09:37:17.123563+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T08:47:28.347255+00:00","content_hash":"a5d1b73a4ac915adf4fdadefeb29f2cb424224eecac2c0fd7a0e2e617b3235f7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:54:08.606771+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}